<title>USA: First Fed Siouxland to split stock 3-for-2.</title>
<headline>First Fed Siouxland to split stock 3-for-2.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY, Iowa 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Federal Savings Bank of Siouxland said Monday that it has declared a 3-for-2 stock split, payable May 16 to shareholders of record May 1.</p>
<p>The company said that no fractional shares wil be issued, and that shareholders entitled to fractional shares will instead receive a whole share.</p>
<p>First Federal also declared a cash dividend of $0.12 per post-split share payable May 30 to shareholders of record May 19. Adjusted for the split, the dividend is unchanged from the previous quarter, said the company.</p>
</text>
